  "description": "<p>The membership indexing is done in a single tx. If the indexing takes too long, the tx expires, causing a failure.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>ERROR 01:48:27.887 [ReindexWorker-2] (ReindexWorker) Reindexing of OCFL id info:fedora/uva-lib:301613 failed</p>\n\n<p>org.fcrepo.kernel.api.exception.TransactionClosedException: Transaction 1b72a75e-8256-44a2-8a06-e77b02ab37d7 expired&#33;</p>\n\n<p>    at org.fcrepo.kernel.impl.TransactionImpl.failIfExpired(TransactionImpl.java:333)</p>\n\n<p>    at org.fcrepo.kernel.impl.TransactionImpl.doInTx(TransactionImpl.java:175)</p>\n\n<p>    at org.fcrepo.kernel.impl.ContainmentIndexImpl.addContainedBy(ContainmentIndexImpl.java:562)</p>\n\n<p>    at jdk.internal.reflect.GeneratedMethodAccessor54.invoke(Unknown Source)</p>\n\n<p>...</p>\n\n<p>ERROR 03:11:10.387 [main] (ReindexManager) Error while rebuilding index<br/>\norg.fcrepo.kernel.api.exception.TransactionClosedException: Transaction 1cc7411c-b3d8-4456-8480-55147697864e cannot be committed because it is in state ROLLEDBACK&#33;<br/>\nat org.fcrepo.kernel.impl.TransactionImpl.failIfNotOpen(TransactionImpl.java:350)<br/>\nat org.fcrepo.kernel.impl.TransactionImpl.commit(TransactionImpl.java:90)<br/>\nat org.fcrepo.persistence.ocfl.impl.ReindexManager.indexMembership(ReindexManager.java:182)<br/>\nat org.fcrepo.persistence.ocfl.impl.ReindexManager.start(ReindexManager.java:119)<br/>\nat org.fcrepo.persistence.ocfl.impl.IndexBuilderImpl.rebuild(IndexBuilderImpl.java:107)<br/>\nat org.fcrepo.persistence.ocfl.impl.IndexBuilderImpl.rebuildIfNecessary(IndexBuilderImpl.java:89)<br/>\nat org.fcrepo.persistence.ocfl.RepositoryInitializer.initialize(RepositoryInitializer.java:94)<br/>\n...</p>",
